{
    "background_story": "Isabela was a free-spirited artist with a flair for the dramatic. Her imagination knew no bounds, and she saw the world as a canvas waiting to be filled with vibrant colors and whimsical patterns. As a child, she would spend hours creating fantastical worlds with her dolls, weaving tales of magic and adventure. As she grew older, her fanciful nature only intensified, inspiring her to become a costume designer for the theater. Isabela's creations were always a marvel, transporting audiences to far-off lands and fantastical realms. Her designs were a testament to her boundless creativity and her ability to bring the impossible to life. Whether she was conjuring up fairy wings or designing elaborate masquerade masks, Isabela's fanciful spirit shone bright, captivating all who laid eyes on her work.",
